        "original_id": "db21d769-fab1-5f08-a0dd-322170ac0fa4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret, Max Green, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Organizations: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers\n- Roles: singer/songwriter, bassist, backing vocalist, rhythm guitarist, vocalist, founder\n\nFacts:\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982, and she is known professionally as Chantal Claret.\n- Chantal Claret is an American singer/songwriter.\n- Max Green was born as Maxwell Scott Green on December 15, 1984, and he is known professionally as Max Green.\n- In 2001, Morningwood was founded and primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Max Green is an American musician who was one of the founders of Escape the Fate.\n- Max Green is a former bassist and backing vocalist for Escape the Fate.\n- Max Green is a former rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.",
